Subject: HID: usbhid quirks
Origin: Batocera, first committed by Nicolas Adenis-Lamarre on 2017-09-22 ("quircks: fix it for x86_64"),
        board/batocera/broadcom/linux_patches/linux-usbhid-quircks.patch
Note: original patch carries no From:/Signed-off-by: header; author taken from the Batocera git history.

